    "bgm": "008",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400304/1004003040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003040160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "予選の時、うち……\r\n練習したこと、完璧に出しきれんかった",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400304/1004003040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう、だったのか……\r\n上手くいっていたように、見えたけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003040170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ほんとはもっとばし～っと決めるはずやったと！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400304/1004003040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003040180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "でも失敗してずっこけそうになったとこ、\r\n何箇所もあって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400304/1004003040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど、そう見えなかったってことは\r\nリカバーが上手くいってたってことだろ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003040190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん……確かに、そうかもしれん\r\nけど、だからこそ",
