    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400304/1004003040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003040220,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "頑張ろうとしてドジをして、そういうのもうちのよさって\r\n……ちゃんとわかっとるけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400304/1004003040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003040230,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ほんとにそれで、\r\nそれだけでいいとかなって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400304/1004003040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\n俺が前に、恋鐘にそう言っちゃったもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004003040240,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "う、ううん……！\r\nプロデューサーは悪くなか！",
